# User-defined secrets shared by this Supabase Edge Runtime.
#
# `make launch supabase` copies this file to functions.env on first launch.
# Add one KEY=value entry per secret to functions.env, then run:
#
#   make up supabase
#
# The local functions.env file is ignored by Git, excluded from OpenDock sync,
# and injected only into the Edge Runtime. It is not mounted into Studio.
# All functions in this single runtime can read every value in this file.
#
# Examples (leave commented until needed):
# EXTERNAL_API_KEY=replace-with-a-real-secret
# WEBHOOK_SIGNING_SECRET=replace-with-a-real-secret
